                        <span class="text-gray-500 font-medium">⏰ Horario:</span>
                        <span id="res-hora" class="font-semibold text-gray-800"></span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="text-gray-500 font-medium">🍰 Postre:</span>
                        <span id="res-postre" class="font-semibold text-gray-800"></span>
                    </p>
